  "description": "What starts as a simple wet dream turns into something a bit too real when Kang Chan is able to see and feel the spirit behind his nightly fantasies. But this spirit named Deulle didn’t just pop up out of nowhere. In fact, he’s been waiting for the day Chan finally noticed him again. Though not as the subject of Chan’s wildest dreams, but as the beloved “imaginary friend” he once grew up with... \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
